# Files a UG2 lift may gain over the baseline (web/tools/ug2-same.sh), one per
# line as all/<name> or server/<name>, each one reviewed: a file that only the
# new lift has passes when it is named here.  A changed or missing file never
# passes.  The reason goes on the comment lines above the name.

# the exe's values the runtime is built with (image, .text, entry point,
# _ftol2), written by tools/genall.py for runtime/cpu.h (TRACKER M1-08); a
# UG2 lift's has main's values, the #define lines of the baseline's
# gameinfo.expect (ug2-same.sh compares them; its --make-expect writes that
# file from main's sources)
all/gameinfo.h
